{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53012","headline":"颂鲜于叔明（题拟） · 严氏","name":"颂鲜于叔明（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三院四人簪白笔，一门三镇拥朱幡。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷一五四《潼川军》引《潼川旧记》引《鲜于叔明神道碑》载）（按：《旧唐书》卷一二二《李叔明传》谓「大历末，有阆州严氏子上疏」云云，因知此二句诗作者，爲大历末人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53012.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53012","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}